zsp 1
colours 2
# mausrun's tiles (docs/mausrun.md, "Art"): 16x16, opaque, in the order
# of their ids -- a level map stores the id, so the order matters and a
# new tile goes at the end. 1 is the tile, 0 its background; the colours
# come from the level's theme. gen_sprites.py makes sprites.c from this;
# a copy at /data/mausrun/tiles.zsp replaces tiles of the same name when
# mausrun starts.
